# Release it

When the user says "release it", ship the current product from this checkout.

## Required

- Commit the pending product work on main and push `origin main`.
- Update the build number in every crate `Cargo.toml`, the web UI `package.json`, and `site/public/releases/latest.txt`.
- Use a patch bump. Use a major bump when the change is a large special update, such as a new subsystem.
- Update the documentation and the website in the same change so version identifiers match the tag. Do not add a What's new or per-version page.
- Publish the GitHub release and wait until all six platform assets exist.
- Rebuild and reinstall the local `ax` binary.

## Forbidden

- Stopping after a local commit without the push and the published release.
- Publishing `latest.txt` before the six platform assets exist.
- A major bump for a small fix.

## Exceptions

- Use a minor bump when the user asks for one.